msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:1644
msgid "Set it up for yourself with <strong>Set up for my account</strong>, and store the backup codes safely."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:1645
msgid "Ask each administrator to do the same from <strong>Users → Profile</strong>. The Two-factor screen lists who uses it, and the dashboard checklist shows how many administrators are covered."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:1647
#, php-format
msgid "To make two-factor mandatory for chosen roles, with a grace period to set it up, see %s (Authlify Pro)."
msgstr ""

