msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:2020
msgid "Alert channels (only those you add)"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:2020
msgid "Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams, Telegram (api.telegram.org) or your own webhook address receive alert messages, which can include a username, IP address and country."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Docs.php:2021
